  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FinaRD2036: Accelerating Investments in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FinaRD2036: Acelerando las Inversiones en la Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la operacin es apoyar elcrecimiento en ventas y empleos de las Micro, Pequeas, y Medianas Empresas (MiPyME) en la Repblica Dominicana impulsando un modelo integral de banca de desarrollo. El objetivo especfico es apoyar la ampliacin del financiamiento para inversiones productivas para las MiPyME a travs del lanzamiento de la primera lnea de segundo piso ofrecida por BANDEX para este tipo de financiamiento</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the operation is to support sales and employment growth among Micro, Small, and Medium-sized Enterprises (MSMEs) in the Dominican Republic by fostering a comprehensive development banking model. The specific objective is to support the expansion of financing for productive investments for MSMEs through the launch of the first second-tier credit line offered by BANDEX for this type of financing.</narrative>
  </description>
